Build Alpine apk packages with:

    bash packaging/build-all.sh
    bash packaging/build-apk.sh amd64   # or arm64, armhf, i386, riscv64

The payload matches the Debian package plus boot/SSH hooks. Architectures
use Alpine names (x86_64, aarch64, armv7, x86, riscv64). Packages are
unsigned; install with `apk add --allow-untrusted` or
`ker upgrade --trust-package`. Do not install on the production host
that already runs ker-guard.
